        "text": "Visited during a cultural event. The park is big, with a kids' playground, a small beach, soccer field and tennis court.\nIt even has parking!\n\nI would remove points for lack of shading area, so on a hot and sunny day, take  precautions, especially if you have kids. Otherwise, a great place for family outings.",
