        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVSQexiGLUk9KgAWz-I5ANqsLYtwY6DfHbPbXlrCc3lzHV0iUaq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "It's the perfect place to wade in the sand, spend some time in the cool shade, sunbathe, and cool off again.\n\n* Easy parking, clean toilets next to the soccer field, and chemical toilets nearby.\n\n* The ideal place to get some fresh air outside the city.\n\n* Canoes, pedal boats, and other watercraft are available for rent on site.\n\n* The swings and deckchairs are conveniently located and offer exceptional views.\n\n=====================\n\nIt's the perfect place to wade in the sand, spend some cool time, sunbathe, and cool off again.\n\n* Easy parking, clean toilets next to the soccer field, and chemical toilets nearby.\n\n* The ideal place to get some fresh air outside the city.\n\n* Canoes, pedal boats, and other watercraft are available for rent on site.\n\n* Swings and deckchairs are conveniently located and offer exceptional views.",
